  "html": "<p><b>Upload your Screenshots here!</b>\n</p><p><i>Use the EDIT button, and follow the model.  If you need help, follow the directions below.</i>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Both.jpg\" title=\"WildDogsLilSis shows that under the right conditions you can have both a Ninja and a Shadow Warg.\"><img alt=\"WildDogsLilSis shows that under the right conditions you can have both a Ninja and a Shadow Warg.\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"350\" src=\"/images/Both.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Both.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>WildDogsLilSis shows that under the right conditions you can have both a Ninja and a Shadow Warg.</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Kill_manglefeet.jpg\" title=\"SuperCrew Posse members WildDogOfTheWildWood and Krysko pwned Manglefeet to complete the Main Event Quest!\"><img alt=\"SuperCrew Posse members WildDogOfTheWildWood and Krysko pwned Manglefeet to complete the Main Event Quest!\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"249\" src=\"/images/Kill_manglefeet.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Kill_manglefeet.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b><a href=\"/wiki/Guild/SuperCrew\" title=\"Guild:SuperCrew\">SuperCrew Posse</a> members WildDogOfTheWildWood and Krysko pwned Manglefeet to complete the <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Event\" title=\"Main Event\">Main Event</a> Quest!</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Pool.jpg\" title=\"Relaxing in the Pool after pwning Manglefeet!\"><img alt=\"Relaxing in the Pool after pwning Manglefeet!\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"281\" src=\"/images/Pool.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Pool.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Relaxing in the Pool after pwning Manglefeet!</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/HDOL_posse.jpg\" title=\"Horrific Dungeon of Legend battle\"><img alt=\"Horrific Dungeon of Legend battle\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"231\" src=\"/images/HDOL_posse.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/HDOL_posse.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Horrific Dungeon of Legend battle</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:224px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/DungeonRunners_Guild_of_Shadows_Training_Chamber_of_Doom_mobs.png\" title=\"Mobs in Guild of Shadows Training Chamber of Doom\"><img alt=\"Mobs in Guild of Shadows Training Chamber of Doom\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"165\" src=\"/images/DungeonRunners_Guild_of_Shadows_Training_Chamber_of_Doom_mobs.png\" width=\"222\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/DungeonRunners_Guild_of_Shadows_Training_Chamber_of_Doom_mobs.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Mobs in Guild of Shadows Training Chamber of Doom</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tleft\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Cat_L100.jpg\" title=\"CatWalksByHimself (the gray haired guy in the middle) and friends streak Townston when he hits L100!\"><img alt=\"CatWalksByHimself (the gray haired guy in the middle) and friends streak Townston when he hits L100!\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"311\" src=\"/images/Cat_L100.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Cat_L100.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>CatWalksByHimself (the gray haired guy in the middle) and friends streak Townston when he hits L100!</b></div></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Screenshots_Help\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Screenshots Help</span></h2>\n<p><b>Here are the directions for entering a screenshot on this page.</b>\n</p><p>1) Capture the picture.  Dungeon Runners has no capability in the main program for screenshot capture.  You have two options:\n</p><p>A)  Use the PRT SCR button on your computer. This will take ONE shot and place it on your clipboard.\n</p><p>B)  Use a third party photo capture program as directed.  This may allow you to capture multiple shots.  If you want a relatively good freeware program, try Zscreen at<br/> <a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://sourceforge.net/projects/zscreen\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"http://sourceforge.net/projects/zscreen\">http://sourceforge.net/projects/zscreen</a>.\n</p><p>2)  EDIT the picture.  It is suggested you trim your picture and scale to 400 pixel width.  Often the brightness needs to be raised to show up better, and the contrast may need to be raised also.  If you are not sure about editing, try uploading the raw picture and one of the mods may work on it.  However it is really appreciated if you can keep the file size under 150Kb.  You can use PhotoShop, or a very good freeware editing program is GIMP at <br/><a class=\"external free\" href=\"http://gimp-win.sourceforge.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"http://gimp-win.sourceforge.net/\">http://gimp-win.sourceforge.net/</a>.\n</p><p>3)  Click on the EDIT button above to put the code for your picture in as instructed.  Click on Save Page.\n</p><p>4)  UPLOAD the picture.  You will not see your picture, but instead you will see the file name in <font color=\"red\"> RED</font>.  Click on that file name to be taken to the UPLOAD screen and follow the directions there.\n</p><p>5) Return to the <strong class=\"selflink\">Screenshots</strong> page, CHECK your picture and adjust as needed.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
